.TH OFGS 1 "August 2026" "OFGS 2.2.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ofgs \- generate and monitor OpenFOAM graphs with gnuplot
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ofgs generate
.br
.B ofgs monitor
.RB [ \-\-live ]
.br
.BI "ofgs graph " id
.RB [ \-\-live ]
.br
.BI "ofgs graph " id1,id2,...
.RB [ \-\-live ]
.br
.B ofgs list
.br
.B ofgs clean
.RB [ \-\-force ]
.br
.B ofgs doctor
.br
.B ofgs help
.br
.BI "ofgs help " command
.br
.B ofgs \-h
.br
.B ofgs \-\-help
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B OFGS
(OpenFOAM Gnuplot Suite) discovers supported OpenFOAM post-processing data
and generates gnuplot dashboards and standalone graph scripts.
It is intended to be run from the root directory of an OpenFOAM case.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B generate
Discover supported datasets and generate
.IR monitor.gp ,
.IR graphs/index.txt ,
and one numbered
.I graphs/NN.gp
script for each logical dataset.
.TP
.B monitor
Open the existing dashboard in
.IR monitor.gp .
With
.BR \-\-live ,
regenerate before opening and regenerate and refresh every two seconds until
interrupted or the window is closed.
.TP
.BI "graph " id
Open the numbered standalone graph identified by
.IR id .
Graph IDs are shown by
.BR "ofgs list" .
.TP
.BI "graph " id1,id2,...
Open the selected comma-separated graph IDs together in one automatically
arranged multiplot window. Duplicate IDs are ignored.
With
.BR \-\-live ,
regenerate before opening and regenerate and refresh every two seconds.
.TP
.B list
Print the generated graph IDs and titles from
.IR graphs/index.txt .
.TP
.B clean
Remove only
.I monitor.gp
and
.I graphs/
from the current directory after confirmation.
OpenFOAM simulation data is never removed.
Use
.B \-\-force
to skip confirmation.
.TP
.B doctor
Perform read-only checks of the OFGS installation, gnuplot and Python
availability, OpenFOAM case directories, generated dashboard files, and
supported datasets.
.TP
.B help
Show the main help page.
When followed by a command name, show help for that command.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-live
For
.B monitor
or
.BR graph ,
regenerate and refresh the selected view every two seconds.
.TP
.B \-\-force
For
.BR clean ,
remove generated files without confirmation.
.TP
.BR \-h , " " \-\-help
Show the main help page.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Generate the dashboard and standalone graph scripts:
.PP
.EX
ofgs generate
.EE
.PP
Open the dashboard with live updates:
.PP
.EX
ofgs monitor --live
.EE
.PP
Open one graph or a selected group:
.PP
.EX
ofgs graph 7
ofgs graph 1,6,7 --live
.EE
.PP
List available graph IDs and titles:
.PP
.EX
ofgs list
.EE
.SH GENERATED FILES
.TP
.I monitor.gp
Gnuplot script for the complete dashboard.
.TP
.I graphs/index.txt
Mapping of graph IDs to graph titles.
.TP
.I graphs/NN.gp
Standalone gnuplot script for graph
.IR NN .
.TP
.I .ofgs-generation.lock
Case-local lock used to serialize graph generation.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PATH
Used to locate the system gnuplot executable and Python 3.
.TP
.B TMPDIR
Directory used for temporary selected multi-graph scripts. Defaults to
.I /tmp
when unset.
